      "writtenOn": "2025-12-18T13:43:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think we want to use a bitset here, this means it will need to be accessible by Dawn and Dawn doesn\u0027t access anything in `src/tint/utils` this way.\n\nWe\u0027d either need to move bitset to `src/utils` which I think would be difficult or use something different. Probably just a `std::array\u003cbool, 16\u003e` would work?",
      "revId": "2a68b56604afeab0410fb0e014d7bad5b0fcd4a0",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
