      "writtenOn": "2025-12-18T13:43:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "```suggestion\n    /// is accessed. Returns an empty bitset if the immediate block is not used.\n```\n\nShould this be `accessed` ? We want to know if the entry point uses that slot, yea?",
      "revId": "2a68b56604afeab0410fb0e014d7bad5b0fcd4a0",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
